From 00654b99d69f6cd26c7a8794b4fa6321c9c3756b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:48:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/34] vulkan: SWIGLU prologue in fwht_row (GLU_FWHT)

{GLU swiglu(gate, up), MUL(signs), RESHAPE, MUL_MAT(H)} runs as one fwht_row dispatch that computes
silu(gate) * up while loading: the FFN GLU dispatch and its intermediate disappear (-64 launches per Bonsai
decode token). Works with the q8_1 epilogue. GGML_VK_DISABLE_GLU_FWHT turns it off. Test: GLU_FWHT.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
